    },
    {
     "role": "body",
     "order": 8,
     "text": "Discover Reply’s point of view and experiences helping retailers to navigate AI-powered development, characterised by real-time intelligence and customer centric innovation."
    },
    {
     "role": "eyebrow",
     "order": 9,
     "text": "White Paper"
    },
    {
     "role": "cta",
     "order": 10,
